@startuml
title Activity 07 - Purchase Request Approval Routing

|System|
start
:Read submitted request;
:Read requester role and department;
if (Requester is Employee?) then (yes)
  :Find Department Executive in same department;
  :Set next approver = Department Executive;
elseif (Requester is Department Executive?) then (yes)
  :Find Manager approver;
  :Set next approver = Manager;
else (Requester is Manager)
  :Assign self-approval route;
endif
if (Approver found?) then (yes)
  :Write approval target and audit entry;
  :Create approval notification;
  :Send approval email;
  |Approver|
  :Open approval queue;
  :Open request detail;
  stop
else (no)
  :Set routing error;
  :Notify Admin and requester;
  stop
endif
@enduml
